ly.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Been a while since I read up on the Rokea, but more or less I still feel its an option if some people want for other animal born.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T02:10:35-07:00","id":1111197,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Black Fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1110865-breeding-stock-question?p=1111052#post1111052\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This is probably the best source of truly native white homid Simba. Lions didn't become extirpated until 1st Century AD in Europe, and didn't disappear from the Caucasus Mountains until the 10th century. The Barbary Lion in North Africa survived until the mid-twentieth century. Various white colonists from Spain, France, and Italy had conquered and ruled parts of North Africa intermittently from the Middle Ages until the mid-twentieth century. And of course, North Africa was part of the Roman Empire and open to immigration from the north, and the region was famously conquered by the Vandals during the fall of the Western Roman Empire. So there is lots of &quot;white&quot; homid stock from there.<br /> <br /> So the most likely scenario is that there were white Simba in Europe until the first century, at which point homid Simba made sure to emigrate to North Africa in order to protect their remaining wild feline stock and their skin color ranged from the slightly darker color of Berbers to the whiter skins of Europeans. After the Arabs invaded, the typical skin color became duskier, but even here &quot;whiter&quot; breeding stock could be obtained from merchant ties to Europe, European invaders, and of course Arab slavers raiding the European coasts. Then once the French arrived in Algeria in the 1800s, there was opportunity for Europeans to carry the Simba legacy. I'd have any white homid Simba elsewhere be a result of immigration from the old French Algeria and similar. Most white homid Simba probably look more North African.<br /> <br /> As for feline Simba, I always assume that the features of their homid forms simply adopt whatever is the dominant form of humanity in the area where they live (Id'do the same in reverse - homids turn into the animal as it would make the most sense as locally). After all, the magic works so the Fera/Garou can blend in. Thus in Africa, it would be almost 100% black. If for some reason, a pre-Change Simba was taken to America for a zoo (or kinfolk lion give birth to a Simba), then what that Simba actually changed, their homid form would match the local population. So most likely it'd be white, but in many American cities, there'd be a good chance the appearance would be black as well with the greater chance based on Pure Breed since feline Simba's pure breed most likely reflects a strict African heritage. Under this, it would even be possible for a Simba's homid form to appear Asian if one was born in say the Ueno Zoo in Tokyo - but let's face it, that would be exceedingly rare and exceptional. Such a homid form, even though it looks local, may still display some features that seem exotic or strange - for example she might tan far easier and far darker than typical).<br /> <br /> Ultimately we're talking about magic stuff here. Do what you think makes sense.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> This.<br /> I'm looking to create a really mature chronicles about racial tensions in sotuhern africa, and the main inspiration is from the bastet book when it says that there are white and black simba.<br /> Due to their nature of dark lords and kings,I think they fit well for this kind of chronicle.<br /> I think I'll use the northern africa/southern europe theory because<br /> 1- Makes a lot of sense. Archeologists found sacred symbols depicted as lions even in the cisalpine gaul<br /> 2- The fera blood can awake even after generations (maybe, with the presence of some nearby fera)<br /> 3- The magical theory makes a lot of sense. Even if the feline/lupus breed carry the homid ancestry, gaias children can shift to adapt to the local pupulation and geographical zone.<br /> 4 - This map can be helpful, and I think it's definitely realistic that some kind of ''white'' breed simba still exist today, breeding with southern africa white people<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://brilliantmaps.com/wp-content/uploads/World_Lion_distribution.png\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://brilliantmaps.com/wp-content/uploads/World_Lion_distribution.png\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://brilliantmaps.com/wp-content/uploads/World_Lion_distribution.png\" target=\"_blank\"> http://brilliantmaps.com/wp-content/uploads/World_Lion_distribution.png </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\">-'' </span>We are the unsullied.<br /> We are the inheritors.<br /> We are the Pure <span style=\"color:#800000\">''-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","name":"Helur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3773_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T10:32:16-07:00","id":1111336,"title":"","content":"I think that it is more likely that the white Bastet are descended from the white 'colonists' of Africa than the original European Simba who are descended from the Asiatic Lion populations of Europe (they were likely killed off during the War of Rage). What could be an interesting side question though would be what happened to the Asian Simba? The Asiatic Lion still exists in India and used to exist throughout Central Asia, South Asia, and West Asia until quite recently.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T15:44:39-07:00","id":1111431,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1110865-breeding-stock-question?p=1111336#post1111336\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think that it is more likely that the white Bastet are descended from the white 'colonists' of Africa than the original European Simba who are descended from the Asiatic Lion populations of Europe (they were likely killed off during the War of Rage). What could be an interesting side question though would be what happened to the Asian Simba? The Asiatic Lion still exists in India and used to exist throughout Central Asia, South Asia, and West Asia until quite recently.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> if they are descendant of the white colonists they are not white, a mixed person will not lose his mixed appearance a generation or two. Unless... we go with the magical tesis, feline simba shifted around white folks, taking their appearance and breeding with them giving life to a new breeding stock.<br /> <br /> Otherwise, when the simba migrated to central and southern africa after the war of Rage, some white simba managed to preserve their bloodline that will takes life again through the colonialists","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\">-'' </span>We are the unsullied.<br /> We are the inheritors.<br /> We are the Pure <span style=\"color:#800000\">''-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","name":"Helur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3773_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T15:54:41-07:00","id":1111436,"title":"","content":"The Dutch have been in South Africa for sixteen generations, so I think that interbreeding with the Dutch that long would have made them as white as any Caucasian in America.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T16:44:36-07:00","id":1111459,"title":"","content":"I tried to attach and image to show a famous pair of interracial twins to show how complicated appearance can be for biracial families. I'm sure a quick google search can show what I was trying to get at. Biracial people have a wide variation of appearances. This is why its so complicated with humans and racial categorization. When does a person cease to be in one category and move into another? With the length of time that the Dutch have been in South Africa you can easily have very Caucasian looking Simba. For me it would be more believable then a relic population who were originally from Europe.<br /> <br /> Also you want a mature commentary on race in South Africa, think about this...white Simba who are descended from colonists, it makes the argument of at what point is something &quot;African&quot; vs &quot;European&quot; in the case of people living in an area for generations, and the diffusion that can go on between groups of people. Just my thoughts but I think white Simba as a result of colonization could introduce a lot into what you are going for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1179,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","user":"CeltSPZ","date":". 07-04-2017, 07:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T17:13:33-07:00","id":1111467,"title":"","content":"While theoretically the Boer could interbreed with native Africans, pick up the Simba &quot;gene&quot; and eventually produce white homid Simba, I think that would be anachronistic for the most part. <br /> The Boers (and later the English) did breed with native Africans in South Africa, but they typically did not keep breeding with their descendants so the family line would become become &quot;white&quot; again. Instead, they became their own mixed population of Coloureds. There's a huge difference between rolling in the hay with someone to produce a baby, and then letting that child, once he or she grows up, actually marry into your society. A mixed baby that was half white and half black simply wasn't accepted as white back in those days. Children of such relations in South Africa became Coloureds, not white. Like any mixed peoples, you can have wide variation between them with some being very dark and looking like Africans and others being able to pass for white. But that doesn't seem to be what Helur is looking for, and the amount of native African blood in the actual white population has to be exceedingly low which would complicate justification for &quot;white&quot; Simba.<br /> <br /> It would only be within the last twenty-five years or so when official legal prohibition against interracial marriages ended that you'd have a scenario where a fairly light skin Coloured who was a Simba kinfolk would marry a white, and their child could be seen as white and have a white homid Simba. But given the relatively low rates of intermarriage and the general Changing Breed dynamics of producing a Fera, they would still be extremely rare.<br /> <br /> You might also have a situation where Portuguese from their old colonies in Angola and Mozambique, who were more open to interracial unions, became Simba kinfolk and emigrated to South Africa after the Portuguese empire in Africa collapsed in 1974. The Portuguese would have been accepted as white and established white Simba there as they intermarried with the local whites, but again this would likely produce only a rare few white Simba.<br /> <br /> On the other hand, once South Africa began producing diamonds and gold in 1868, white emigration to South Africa skyrocketed. The white population of South Africa went from around 180,000 in 1865 to 1.2 million in 1910. This would provide cover for some of those remaining few Mediterranean Simba kinfolk to arrive and marry with each other and the rest of the whites.<br /> <br /> Depending on what Helur wants to do, this could be advantageous for him in a chronicle about racial tensions. It wouldn't just be white Simba and black Simba, but Coloured Simba plus divisions between the white Simba based on their origin (the Mediterranean Simba, the Portuguese Simba (which might be a comination of Med and local), and perhaps a rare few white Simba who truly have a local origin as descendant from a local African).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T17:33:32-07:00","id":1111473,"title":"","content":"Well my issue though is, when did the Mediterranean Simba die out in cannon? When did they move to South Africa for this chronicle? If it was long enough ago, why they would still be Caucasian in their homid form today, instead of taking in Native humans for kin? Did they have a large population of Caucasian kin come with them? I guess for me I'm having a hard time figuring out the timeline for when the Mediterranean Simba arrived.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T19:23:07-07:00","id":1111501,"title":"","content":"I doubt that they would have possessed enough Human Kinfolk to maintain their 'whiteness' for the two thousand years of their exile. Anyway, their Animal Kinfolk were the Asiatic Lions, not the African Lions, so they would have gone east rather than gone south. Without their Animal Kinfolk, they would have gone extinct within a couple of generations.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-04T19:51:04-07:00","id":1111516,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1110865-breeding-stock-question?p=1111501#post1111501\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I doubt that they would have possessed enough Human Kinfolk to maintain their 'whiteness' for the two thousand years of their exile.</div> </div> </div> </div>This was along the lines of what I was thinking.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1179,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","user":"CeltSPZ","date":". 07-04-2017, 11:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-05T07:04:18-07:00","id":1111641,"title":"","content":"first, thank you all for your suggestions, as always you're all great.<br /> <br /> Due to the fact that there are really few wild lions around the world, I like to mix a scientific-ancestry theory with some pure spirit magic from werewolf.<br /> It's essential for the chronicle that the players go thorugh the extreme pride and brutal nature of the simba, tasting fear from racial tensions, both from human society and bastet society.<br /> That's the incipit of my chronicle:<br /> Black tooth was extremely aggressive toward europeans, so, I suppose that any white-like or mixed simba must be submitted or killed by him or the endless storm. In the story, under black tooth the white lions are threatened by african lions, and used as cannon fodder.<br /> After the fall of black tooth some white simba decided to seek revenge against some pride made up by black simba. <br /> The white simba will be a result of berber white breeding stock (yes of course.. not saying that berber are all uber pure white) mixed with various colonialists during the colonization of Africa.<br /> To me, it make sense, also due to the fact the simba are extremely proud and aggressive when is a matter of blood and family. So, basically it has sense to me that the white bloodlines wanted to preserve their ethnicity and they saw opportunity to preserve it with the colonists. The berber lion disappeared during 900'', I think it make sense.<br /> The simba are perfect for a chronicle based on racial tension. <br /> sorry for my rusty english guys.<br /> <br /> Edit:don't forget that in northern Africa the Lions are extincted from 1945. Also on Europe the wolf is no more in a lot of nations but werewolves still breed . Due to the terrible and proud nature of the simba I think that is not stupid that some white berber Simba lineage managed to breed in Northern Africa between homid white kinfolk and then mixed with the colonists in 1600, they probably looked at them as potential new breeding stock to keep their lineage pure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\">-'' </span>We are the unsullied.<br /> We are the inheritors.<br /> We are the Pure <span style=\"color:#800000\">''-</span>","edited":{"userid":3773,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","user":"Helur","date":". 07-05-2017, 01:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","name":"Helur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3773_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-06T06:03:28-07:00","id":1112070,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Helur</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1110865-breeding-stock-question#post1110865\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> 